Description: FileBrowser Quantum for TOS 7
 TOS 7 packaging of the official FileBrowser Quantum binary (Apache-2.0).
 The bundled executable is the unmodified upstream v2.0.2-stable release
 asset for this architecture. Its origin, purpose, upstream commit and
 SHA-256 are recorded in BUILD_PROVENANCE.md, with an SPDX SBOM at
 SBOM.spdx.json. This package is a wrapper and does not claim upstream
 copyright.
